WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
I'm with Norm who is going to teach me the very basics of stage fighting.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:05.640
What are you going to teach me, Norm?

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.840
We'll start with choking, or strangling properly

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:13.420
We are in an alley by a pub. So this is pretty much prime choking territory(!)

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.820
Absolutely it is.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.520
So we're going to start with you choking me.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.260
Okay.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.660
Right, so, the best way to do 'stage choking' or strangling rather

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.420
is that you do nothing.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.660
Okay, I like this.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:31.180
So literally put your hand on my breastbone, chestplate --

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.860
Do you want to get in closer on that, so I can see where I'm putting this?

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.860
-- Do nothing.
-- Okay.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.860
Let me do all of the work.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.400
I'll grab your hand and go--

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.020
That is good!

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:54.180
The key is that I am in control so I can pull your hand in as tight as I feel comfortable with

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:58.760
so for people who are very unhappy at the idea of being choked

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.160
Yeah. I do not like anyone being here.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.920
-- So shall I try it on you?
-- Yeah, okay.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.980
-- So you place your hand just down here?
-- Yeah, I'd put it there

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:09.060
And you are now in control and I literally do nothing.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.260
Woah!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.220
There you go!

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.640
There we go! Thank you Norm! That is how to stage choke someone

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.640
and that is something you might not have known!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.260
